    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I'm looking to make toggle maps in the style of mini.basics toggle diagnostics, where i'd like to print the end state of the toggle after. is there an api or other way to check if mini.diff is enabled and if the overlay is enabled?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'm looking to make toggle maps in the style of mini.basics toggle diagnostics, where i'd like to print the end state of the toggle after. is there an api or other way to check if mini.diff is enabled and if the overlay is enabled?</p>",
    "bodyText": "I'm looking to make toggle maps in the style of mini.basics toggle diagnostics, where i'd like to print the end state of the toggle after. is there an api or other way to check if mini.diff is enabled and if the overlay is enabled?",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
