    },
    "closed": true,
    "closedAt": "2024-07-15T05:41:48Z",
    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, there is. Take a look at [`get_buf_data()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb19e8442edd63b033c36daf8d29c0158c9f1eb9/doc/mini-diff.txt#L478-L495):\r\n- It [returns `nil` if buffer is disabled](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb19e8442edd63b033c36daf8d29c0158c9f1eb9/doc/mini-diff.txt#L486) and a table otherwise.\r\n- For enabled buffers with attached source the table has [`overlay` field](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb19e8442edd63b033c36daf8d29c0158c9f1eb9/doc/mini-diff.txt#L490) showing whether an overlay is active.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, there is. Take a look at <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb19e8442edd63b033c36daf8d29c0158c9f1eb9/doc/mini-diff.txt#L478-L495\"><code class=\"notranslate\">get_buf_data()</code></a>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>It <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb19e8442edd63b033c36daf8d29c0158c9f1eb9/doc/mini-diff.txt#L486\">returns <code class=\"notranslate\">nil</code> if buffer is disabled</a> and a table otherwise.</li>\n<li>For enabled buffers with attached source the table has <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb19e8442edd63b033c36daf8d29c0158c9f1eb9/doc/mini-diff.txt#L490\"><code class=\"notranslate\">overlay</code> field</a> showing whether an overlay is active.</li>\n</ul>",
            "bodyText": "Yes, there is. Take a look at get_buf_data():\n\nIt returns nil if buffer is disabled and a table otherwise.\nFor enabled buffers with attached source the table has overlay field showing whether an overlay is active.",
